        Unit - A unit Dies
    Conditions
        (Triggering unit) Equal to NPC_Horde_AI_Warlock
    Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (NPC_Horde_AI_Warlock is in Companion_Group.) Equal to True
                InCinematic Equal to False
            Then - Actions
                Game - Display to (All players) the text: (|cffffff00|r + ((Proper name of (Triggering unit)) + ( (|cff6f2583Warlock|r) +  |cffffffffhas|r |cffff0000died!|r)))
            Else - Actions
        -------- Start timer --------
        Countdown Timer - Start ReviveTimerWarlock as a One-shot timer that will expire in 60.00 seconds
        -------- Drop items --------
        -------- ================ SET all states that might bug the AI hero --------
